-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §157: the Ministry announces that it means to
-- take on new teaching employees under the reform only with an academic
-- degree and a teaching certificate.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `157`

-- An announcement of intent, not a rule of hiring: what it says the
-- Ministry means to do.
@ref akn:art_157
GIVEN `has an academic degree` IS A BOOLEAN, `has a teaching certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `one the Ministry means to hire as a new teacher` `has an academic degree` `has a teaching certificate` IF
    `has an academic degree` AND `has a teaching certificate`

#ASSERT NOT `one the Ministry means to hire as a new teacher` TRUE FALSE
